OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we know about RAF Fairford
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of explosive and terrorism
OL,8,Foffences after a major incident was
OL,9,Fdeclared at an airbase in the west of
OL,10,FEngland.
OL,12,FBomb disposal teams have been examining
OL,13,Fa number of vehicles near RAF Fairford
OL,14,Fin Gloucestershire and dozens of homes
OL,15,Fin the surrounding area have been
OL,16,Fevacuated.
OL,18,FHere is a summary of what we know so
OL,19,Ffar.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
