OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we know about RAF Fairford
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FRAF Fairford is located in the
OL,7,FCotswolds, about four miles (6.4km)
OL,8,Fsouth of the town of Fairford, which
OL,9,Fsits along the River Coln.
